        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Comparison figure shows the gallery plate, the amber Schnakenberg field, the dispersion with the corrected control, and the chronoseries bars. Computer-vision similarity of the 12-frame 720x540 GIF against the plate is 96.0 because the terminal frame is the plate. Specimen-match stays at 82 because the plate is not a 1.8 µm micrograph of berryi pigment; foreground fraction 0.3445 versus an a priori target 0.55 records that gap." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
